# Beast 3.0 Veterans Affairs Division

The Veterans Affairs Division serves as the primary coordination node for former military personnel, service members, and their dependents within the Beast 3.0 governance framework.

## Mission

Deliver rapid, transparent, and respectful support services, automated benefit routing, emergency assistance, and honor verification for military veterans.

## Core Responsibilities

- Service Verification & Credentials (DD-214 / SBT Badges)
- Benefit Claims Processing & Tracking
- Emergency Relief & Housing Support Allocation
- Healthcare, Mental Health & Peer Network Routing
- Honor Records & Service Recognition Archives

## Connected Systems

- Resource Eligibility Division (`beast3-resource-eligibility`)
- Treasury & Revenue Division (`beast3-treasury-revenue`)
- Identity & Credentials Division (`beast3-identity-credentials`)
- Judicial & Audit Division (`beast3-judicial-audit`)

## Status

Development
